// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P1882787464" "All units, we have an APB out on a cell of the {VillainGroup} in connection with a missing person case."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P2125344034" "We have reports of a break-in at the home of one {PERSON_NAME}, reportedly conducted by the {VillainGroup}. Requesting a unit investigate."
