"P4286803598" "{PERSON_NAME} has gone missing from the space development conference. Undercover officers at the scene report spotting members of the {VillainGroup} nearby."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P1149774305" "There's a missing person report on {PERSON_NAME} from the space conference. We also have a report of the {VillainGroup} in the area."
