"P3342758171" "Detectives are reporting one of their own has gone missing while investigating the {VillainGroup}."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P2126007873" "A witness against the {VillainGroup}, one {PERSON_NAME} has gone missing. All units are advised to be on the lookout for her."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P3590741941" "We have reports of a missing businessman, one {PERSON_NAME}. Business associates report seeing individuals conforming to the appearance of the {VillainGroup} recently."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P1425745539" "We have a report of suspicious individuals accompanying {PERSON_NAME}. Possible kidnapping in progress."
