// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P3151912426" "{PERSON_NAME}, a prominent industrial designer, has not been seen since her last day off, and there is security camera footage showing members of the {VillainGroup} in the area. Police units advised that this may be a kidnapping in progress."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P955140229" "Detectives are reporting that they have been unable to locate {PERSON_NAME}, the noted cybernetic research. The {VillainGroup} ultimatum may be legitimate. All units are advised to be on the lookout for any clues."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P2830500612" "We've received a concerned inquiry from Portacio industries about one of their designers, one {PERSON_NAME}, who hasn't been seen in several days."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P3803701919" "Police detectives are reporting that there may be a wave of computer virus attacks imminent after reformed hacker {PERSON_NAME} went missing last week."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P3007945311" "All units, be on the lookout. We have an unconfirmed report of {PERSON_NAME} seen accompanied by members of the {VillainGroup}."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P182623023" "Police detectives report that their tail of Aeon Corporation manager {PERSON_NAME} was broken when they were attacked by members of the {VillainGroup}."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P2232627855" "Detectives are reporting that {PERSON_NAME}, a local cable TV magnate, may have been the target of a {VillainGroup} operation."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P3347137099" "We have reports that an ex-government agent has gone missing. Be on the lookout."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P1217522869" "We have a possible missing person on one {PERSON_NAME}."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P2147966530" "Be on the lookout: We have a missing persons report from a local UHF station for a {PERSON_NAME} from George, the station manager."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P2585031394" "The BB Institute's press conference was attacked by members of the {VillainGroup}, who have escaped with a hostage."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P132519773" "We have a report from the feds that they've lost a sample of something called a 'Human bomb serum'. They are advising everyone to keep an eye out for unusual disappearances."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P1853725270" "We've received word from the Feds that the {VillainGroup} have escaped with a sample of an intelligent bioweapon."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
"P151261750" "All units, we've received word from a Kord Industries security that the VP, one {PERSON_NAME}, has not reported in to work for several days. Detectives are investigating the situation."
// Script Variable HeadlineString :
