// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable Group - depends_on_Person Var Name - INTRODUCTION_STRING 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1966967495" "You remember hearing that some of the {VillainGroup} were talking about kidnapping {PERSON_NAME}, the computer network designer. They might have gone for it. Perhaps you could investigate?"
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P545578328" "{PERSON_NAME} is on the cutting edge of on-line real estate and property. On-line, she's one of the wealthiest people in the world, and a major influence in many circles. Maybe that's what the {VillainGroup} are interested in. Her list of connections is probably extraordinary."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P529995243" "{PERSON_NAME} is one of the guests at the big space conference. You remember hearing something about a new space propulsion system he was working on. The {VillainGroup} might be interested in something about that."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3080598661" "The big space science conference has drawn a lot of top minds, but that could also draw in opportunistic criminals like the {VillainGroup}. Dr. Deering could just be out sight-seeing, but it could also be trouble."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P4107231614" "According to the radio, {PERSON_NAME} went undercover to investigate the {VillainGroup}, and hasn't been heard from since. He could be doing deep cover work, or he could be in trouble."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P4116320218" "{PERSON_NAME} is just a law-abiding citizen willing to risk her life to testify against the {VillainGroup}. If something really has happened to her, it might worth investigating."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3256125349" "There were rumors that some {VillainGroup} types were boasting about a big score. Maybe Mr. Levis was it? This could bear investigation."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3928761558" "You'd heard rumors that the {VillainGroup} were casing out {PERSON_NAME} and her shipping business. They might be in trouble."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P771457334" "{PERSON_NAME}? That's the lead designer of the smash-hit video game Freedom Phalanx. You'd heard several of the {VillainGroup} complaining about how they were portrayed in that game. Maybe they decided to get some developer feedback."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3775104622" "There were rumors that the {VillainGroup} were interested in re-designing some of their equipment for greater efficiency. And knowing their wicked ways, they might have taken {PERSON_NAME} to force her into helping them."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P4159972447" "You heard about this situation. The {VillainGroup} claim to have {PERSON_NAME}, and are holding him hostage until their demands are met. While there's no proof, {PERSON_NAME} hasn't been seen in a few days."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2728026417" "Word on the street is that the {VillainGroup} were poking around, asking about Portacio's designers. Maybe they had a hand in this?"
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3009638763" "Word on the street is that the {VillainGroup} have been preparing for a spree of computer crime for a while, and the name {PERSON_NAME} fits. You don't know if this was a kidnapping or if hey recruited {PERSON_NAME}, but either way, it would be good to stop this before it got started."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P361271725" "{PERSON_NAME}? The reclusive mathematical genius? She hasn't been seen in a while, but from what you've read that's not uncommon. Still, this might be worth your attention."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P976624430" "{PERSON_NAME}'s just a mid-level manager, but a mid-level manager with the Aeon Corporation, and that company is inextricably tied to Arachnos. According to police chatter, the detectives weren't hurt, but they lost {PERSON_NAME} and haven't been able to find him. Something tells you that attack was a distraction for the cops while the bad guys grabbed their real target: {PERSON_NAME}."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1111033007" "This would match the word you've heard on the street that the {VillainGroup} were planning to do something involving a major media outlet. It might be a false lead, or it could be something you could nip in the bud right away."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1854937466" "You get a few more details. The former agent is called {PERSON_NAME}, and he supposedly worked at a top-secret government base in Nevada. Come to think of it, there was some talk that the {VillainGroup} were gunning to grab an ex-fed."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1472403500" "{PERSON_NAME} is one of those types all heroes know to keep an eye out for. She's actually a powerful psychic, capable of manifesting her dreams in the real world. Unfortunately, she can't control her power, so if she goes off her medication and has a nightmare, it can be bad. You might have a lead on this."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1789902093" "It looks like someone grabbed channel 52's resident tech-head. You'd heard rumors that the {VillainGroup} were planning some scheme involving pirating broadcast signals. That might connect to this."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2670949215" "According to the police report, the missing person is {PERSON_NAME}. The {VillainGroup} grabbed her, and now the BB Institute's own crime-fighters are  paralyzed. But the {VillainGroup} probably aren't expecting the BBI to get some outside help."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2699144046" "Uh-oh. You'd heard that the {VillainGroup} were looking to grab some street people after they'd made a big score, but it didn't seem to make sense. But if they have the human bomb formula, they might be looking for test subjects!"
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1252242794" "Uh-oh. You'd heard that the {VillainGroup} were looking to grab some street people after they'd made a big score, but it didn't seem to make sense. But if they have that intelligent bioweapon, they might be looking for test subjects!"
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2322000940" "The police detectives may be on the case, but you'd heard a rumor that the {VillainGroup} had their eyes on {PERSON_NAME} as a mark for a while. If they made their move, you'd have the inside track to find them and put a stop to it."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3468388919" "Widows and Orphans credit union is dedicated to helping those unfortunates struck by tragedy to rebuild their lives. While the police will be on this one, maybe you could give them some help."

