// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P2596240366" "I have much to do back at the station. George needs my help."
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P2115823301" "Thanks for the help!"
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P2854126645" "Actually, all that injection did was give me gas."
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P1498798101" "It's funny, but these little guys have a lot of good advice. I think this could work out really well."
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P600865955" "Nice work. You took those guys down like some kinda war machine."
// Script Variable SAYONRESCUE_STRING :
"P3630390996" "Those fiends!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable Group - depends_on_Person Var Name - SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P1971523065" "What's the rush, {HeroName}? Oh."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P2861927383" "Yikes!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P2485544719" "Oh, dear."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P4132675831" "Ran into a bit of trouble."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P2855255519" "I gotta get wise one of these days."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P1300345063" "Trouble."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P3753845477" "Sorry. I got a bit distracted."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P2307665877" "Uh-oh."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P598251143" "No, this is a bad situation."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P1094219486" "This is frustrating."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P59189125" "Like moths to a flame."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P3542411095" "What a day!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P2768752041" "This sUxx0rs"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P2866360275" "All these interruptions!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P2050008400" "Eek!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P4229774339" "Oh *bleep*!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P1873613311" "This part will definitely be classified."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P1702362694" "WakeUpWakeUpWakeUp!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P653726018" "Oh."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P2295940555" "Oh no!"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P1825256980" "*Uuurp*! Oh, sorry."
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P1307986893" "Uh-huh. Yeah, I'll start eating better and... Did I just get lost?"
// Script Variable SAYONRECAPTURE_STRING :
"P1336463413" "I wish I had my... <em> Uh, nothing."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable Group - depends_on_Person Var Name - SAYONARRIVAL_STRING 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P3872403949" "This is all going on my blog."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P3507983360" "Could you not mention this to my Mom, {HeroName}? She doesn't like me living alone as it is."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P64869527" "The Kheldians give us their science, we steal technology from Rikti war wreckage... <em>And still I am so proud I must seek our own way to the stars."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P2227072760" "We couldn't even do science without people like you working to keep the world safe."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P963564687" "Thanks for the pick. I still need to find where these jokers' gats sprang from, but I'm a step closer now they think I have a guardian angel."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P2277380470" "You heroes, you really do care about everyone, don't you? Thanks for that, and everything else you do."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P3318171978" "Well... That was a unique experience."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P479442708" "Thank you for the rescue. Now I've got to get back to my business!"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P4083596875" "That was like the siege of Thermopolae, only we won!"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P2059651183" "Don't think I don't understand how much you sacrifice for people, {HeroName}. Thanks."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P1149600610" "What a fascinating experience. It's given me a fantastic new cyberware idea!"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P4196410105" "I can't wait to get back to work, er home. Ah, they're pretty much the same for me, anyway."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P201373598" "Wait till I tell everyone on Dotslash about this. Totally freakin' awesome."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P1396340573" "I still think I prefer theory, but you were very impressive in action."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P618400564" "You, you really were just here to help me? That's not at all like what Arachnos says heroes are like..."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P3262956182" "Thanks for the help. I'll have to get a marathon of your favorite show scheduled to thank you."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P1711642095" "I offer you my sincerest, though still highly classified, thanks."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P2697312008" "I'm so glad you're real, {HeroName}. You are real, aren't you?"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P2165113633" "My work here is done."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P3238155688" "These guys might have gotten the Occelthruster if you hadn't shown up. Thanks!"
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P4168059628" "I think I'll go to the hospital, just in case."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P1326556793" "You know, I think getting infected with an intelligent bioweapon is the best thing that ever happened to me."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P4237380290" "Thanks for the help. I actually was expecting someone else, but you did a great job."
// Script Variable SAYONARRIVAL_STRING :
"P3635662782" "Thanks for helping me, and all the widows and orphans who bank with us."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable Group - depends_on_Person Var Name - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P479149185" "We don't have time for this."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1656012965" "The real prize is all the contacts you have."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1184336535" "You'll give us your work, or else!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3672525343" "And profit is a useful business to be in."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2497271242" "I can't stand cool guys."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3722205129" "You won't tell anyone anything anymore."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1576786479" "Tell me about it!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1743405463" "She's lying."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4039286324" "This is personal."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3715276265" "Actually, you know, she might have a point."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3432239212" "This guy is starting to creep me out."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1936506665" "I resent that."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P191726610" "Whatever helps you sleep at night."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1359419325" "We'll make YOU theoretical!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P498895416" "Tell us the truth!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P639148352" "It's genius!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P784681375" "And Bigfoot!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2863105463" "Dude, we're totally figments of her imagination."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3205930353" "Does something seem... Wrong with this guy?"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4082198517" "Uhh... We really don't have a 'Pit' here."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P480703569" "It'll be all over soon."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1919508305" "Once we know it works, it will be ours to control!"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2993457265" "Very funny."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P785645904" "Mua-hah-hah-hah!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable Group - depends_on_Person Var Name - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1224523674" "{PERSON_NAME} is our tool now."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3173145680" "No way some hero is going to interfere with out plans!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2888404189" "All this science had me bored. Let's fight!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2612017911" "Stop {HeroName}! This will ruin everything!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P816109025" "I'll show you how we do it."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3412743697" "Like a hero can save you now!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P864872087" "Retirement's important, but you have to think about today, too."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3611631437" "It'll be quick."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2227447677" "That bug they fixed totally ruined my favorite exploit!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1433193102" "I ain't ready to go straight yet!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1732233547" "Maybe we should let {HeroName} take him..."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2707577070" "We'll show you!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3469881696" "You slimy weasel!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2640766050" "We'll show you something real!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2147329255" "We ain't done with this one yet."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1019386408" "I could handle this fight by remote control!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1819266887" "Even while fighting {HeroName}, I can still be interested in Cryptozoology!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2677397711" "Being imaginary ain't so bad. Otherwise, this would hurt a lot."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4088951509" "Get 'em!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3039100935" "Laugh while you can, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4198463534" "Look at the label: 'Will not work if subject has imbibed alcohol in the last 24 hours'!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3205157123" "We gotta handle {HeroName} first!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3539598409" "How did you know?"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P762239845" "Evil feels so good!"
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P2282617145" "You're off to rescue a hapless citizen. You only hope you're not too late."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P538085942" "{PERSON_NAME} will be safe and sound if you have anything to say about it."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P3301890576" "Hold on just a little while longer, {PERSON_NAME}. Help is on the way."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P551284740" "{VillainGroup} kidnapping helpless citizens? Not on your watch!"
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P1966578268" "Kidnapping. Just when you thought the {VillainGroup} couldn't sink any lower."
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P4221316746" "I hear {HeroName} rescued {PERSON_NAME}. How incredible!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P1687490144" "YEAH! Go get 'em, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P4142109950" "{HeroName}! We love you!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P1665911615" "Of course {HeroName} saved the day! Was there ever any doubt?"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P1807141838" "I hear {HeroName} waltzed right out of there with {PERSON_NAME} safely in tow."
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P3790783909" "You're the best, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P908185670" "{HeroName}! That's like awesome to the power of totally radical!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P208014146" "No bad guy can stop {HeroName}, and that's the truth!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P31758032" "{HeroName}! You're the greatest!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P2252847652" "{HeroName} patrolling the streets, and the world is a safer place!"
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P3957996145" "We all owe {HeroName} a debt we can never repay."
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P762815897" "Any city protected by brightly clad weirdos like {HeroName} is a city you can feel safe in."
// Script Variable RANDOM_FAME_STRING :
"P1241829100" "We believe in you, {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P1302085186" "If you're right, {PERSON_NAME} should be around here somewhere."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P1244676554" "Word on the street is this is where {VillainGroup} is hiding {PERSON_NAME}."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P2089423365" "Did {VillainGroup} really believe they could hide {PERSON_NAME} here?"
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P239706415" "There's ample evidence that the {VillainGroup} are here, and most likely with a hostage."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P279712055" "{VillainGroup} must be desperate to hide {PERSON_NAME}, so desperate they got sloppy."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P434003622" "Time to rescue a hapless Citizen from the clutches of evil."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P1944346193" "If those {VillainGroup} villains have hurt {PERSON_NAME}, there will be trouble."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P3771821530" "Fortunately you were able to pinpoint this place. Now you can only hope you're not too late."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P2325860548" "You don't know how much time {PERSON_NAME} has left at the hands of the {VillainGroup}, but you hope it will be enough."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P2893629657" "Time to help the innocent and punish the guilty."
// Script Variable ENTRY_STRING :
"P4245859908" "These idiots deserve everything  that's coming to them for this outrage against the citizens of Paragon City."

